  "title": "RTPS: New PIDs coming from the productization of RPC",
  "description": "- Add `PID_RELATED_ENTITY_GUID` with a `0x0081` identifier value, containing a GUID.\n- Rename `PID_RELATED_ORIGINAL_WRITER_INFO` with `PID_RELATED_ORIGINAL_WRITER_INFO_LEGACY`. This one has the identifier value of `0x0083`. It is an older, non-standard PID.\n- Add `PID_RELATED_ORIGINAL_WRITER_INFO` with a `0x0083` identifier value. It contains the same as the old PID (now `PID_RELATED_ORIGINAL_WRITER_INFO_LEGACY`): a GUID and a sequence number.\n\n\n**Example captures and screenshots**\n\n[PID_RELATED_ORIGINAL_WRITER_INFO.pcapng](/uploads/3264727e7db4185debd23ce2092508cf/PID_RELATED_ORIGINAL_WRITER_INFO.pcapng)\n![PID_RELATED_ORIGINAL_WRITER_INFO](/uploads/1776ab619a4ce4f49fe02bc2d2c1975a/PID_RELATED_ORIGINAL_WRITER_INFO.png)\n\n[PID_RELATED_ORIGINAL_WRITER_INFO_LEGACY.pcapng](/uploads/6e8c137cd9d6fc32ce25dee49097c055/PID_RELATED_ORIGINAL_WRITER_INFO_LEGACY.pcapng)\n![PID_RELATED_ORIGINAL_WRITER_INFO_LEGACY](/uploads/8f628be51933ea0a05cf2046caed90f5/PID_RELATED_ORIGINAL_WRITER_INFO_LEGACY.png)\n\n[PID_RELATED_ENTITY_GUID.pcapng](/uploads/c8b1c6aed45e30663d8ea16574dabac6/PID_RELATED_ENTITY_GUID.pcapng)\n![PID_RELATED_ENTITY_GUID](/uploads/7cd6f4d5022bc48f8cffdc4bd272a585/PID_RELATED_ENTITY_GUID.png)",
